# Build contexts for docker/*.Dockerfile — keep prune inputs small.
.git
.github
.cursor
.turbo
**/.turbo
.next
**/.next
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
# `**/` matters: a bare `.env` pattern only matches the context root, so
# `apps/web/.env` was copied in and Next traced it into the standalone output —
# baking a developer's real local credentials into the runtime image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
infra
agent-transcripts
**/.DS_Store
apps/web/e2e
apps/**/vitest*.ts
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.md
!README.md
